67985	68171	67903	67903	she	119	“ Ay , no doubt : but that is what a governess will prevent ; and if I had known your mother , I should have advised her most strenuously to engage one . I always say that nothing is to be done in education without steady and regular instruction , and nobody but a governess can give it . It is wonderful how many families I have been the means of supplying in that way . I am always glad to get a young person well placed out . Four nieces of Mrs. Jenkinson are most delightfully situated through my means ; and it was but the other day that I recommended another young person , who was merely accidentally mentioned to me , and the family are quite delighted with her . Mrs. Collins , did I tell you of Lady Metcalfe ’s calling yesterday to thank me ? She finds Miss Pope a treasure . ‘ Lady Catherine , ’ said she , ‘ you have given me a treasure . ’ Are any of your younger sisters out , Miss Bennet ? ”
